---

<Layout 
	title="Caçamba de Entulho em Guarulhos | Aluga Caçamba Garantido"
	description="Caçamba de entulho em Guarulhos para reformas, obras, condomínios e empresas. Consulte capacidades e solicite entrega e retirada pelo WhatsApp."
	preloadImage="/home_truck.webp"
>
	<!-- 1. Hero -->
	<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-10 lg:gap-12">
		<!-- Texto (Esquerda) -->
		<div class="flex-1 w-full text-center lg:text-left">
			<span class="inline-block py-2 px-4 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 font-bold text-sm mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">
				Soluções para obras, condomínios e empresas
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[52px] font-black leading-none tracking-tighter text-gray-900">
				Caçamba de Entulho <br /> <span class="text-green-700">Em Guarulhos</span>
			</h1>
			
			<p class="text-base text-gray-600 mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
				Alugue caçamba de entulho em Guarulhos para reformas, condomínios, construtoras, empresas e demolições. Orientamos a escolha do tamanho conforme o volume, o peso e o tipo de resíduo da obra.
			</p>

			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center lg:justify-start gap-5 mt-10">
			<a href="https://wa.me/5511943758808" target="_blank" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-10 py-5 bg-green-700 text-white text-base font-black rounded-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 shadow-xl hover:shadow-green-700/40 gap-2">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                    <path d="M13.601 2.326A7.854 7.854 0 0 0 7.994 0C3.627 0 .068 3.558.064 7.926c0 1.399.366 2.76 1.057 3.965L0 16l4.204-1.102a7.933 7.933 0 0 0 3.79.965h.004c4.368 0 7.926-3.558 7.93-7.93A7.898 7.898 0 0 0 13.6 2.326zM7.994 14.521a6.573 6.573 0 0 1-3.356-.92l-.24-.144-2.494.654.666-2.433-.156-.251a6.56 6.56 0 0 1-1.007-3.505c0-3.626 2.957-6.584 6.591-6.584a6.56 6.56 0 0 1 4.66 1.931 6.557 6.557 0 0 1 1.928 4.66c-.004 3.639-2.961 6.592-6.592 6.592zm3.615-4.934c-.197-.099-1.17-.578-1.353-.646-.182-.065-.315-.099-.445.099-.133.197-.513.646-.627.775-.114.133-.232.148-.43.05-.197-.1-.836-.308-1.592-.985-.59-.525-.985-1.175-1.103-1.372-.114-.198-.011-.304.088-.403.087-.088.197-.232.296-.346.1-.114.133-.198.198-.33.065-.134.034-.248-.015-.347-.05-.099-.445-1.076-.612-1.47-.16-.389-.323-.335-.445-.34-.114-.007-.247-.007-.38-.007a.729.729 0 0 0-.529.247c-.182.198-.691.677-.691 1.654 0 .977.71 1.916.81 2.049.098.133 1.394 2.132 3.383 2.992.47.205.84.326 1.129.418.475.152.904.129 1.246.08.38-.058 1.171-.48 1.338-.943.164-.464.164-.86.114-.943-.049-.084-.182-.133-.38-.232z"/>
                </svg>
					Chamar no WhatsApp
				</a>
				<a href="/servicos" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-10 py-5 bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 text-base font-black rounded-xl transition-all hover:bg-gray-200 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
					Conhecer Soluções
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Imagem (Direita) -->
		<div class="flex-1 w-full">
			<div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white hover:shadow-primary/20 transition-all">
				<img 
					src="/home_truck.webp" 
					alt="Caminhão com caçamba estacionária verde para entulho" 
					width="900"
					height="750"
					loading="eager"
					fetchpriority="high"
					decoding="async"
					class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video lg:aspect-[4/3.05] hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- 2. Estrutura para obras e operações -->
	<section class="w-[100vw] relative left-[50%] right-[50%] -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] px-6 py-24 bg-green-50">
		<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-[47px] font-black text-center text-[#1c2331] mb-4 tracking-tighter">
				Estrutura para <span class="text-green-700">obras e operações</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">Organizamos a capacidade, a entrega e as retiradas conforme a rotina da obra, do condomínio ou da empresa.</p>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm">
					<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1c2331] mb-4 tracking-tighter">Planejamento de Capacidade</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed">Orientamos a escolha da caçamba conforme o tipo de resíduo, o volume estimado, o acesso ao local e a rotina da operação.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm">
					<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.95 11.95 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1c2331] mb-4 tracking-tighter">Troca Programada</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed">Planejamos entregas, retiradas e substituições para obras com geração contínua de resíduos, reduzindo acúmulos e interrupções no canteiro.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white p-10 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-sm">
					<div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-8">
						<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1c2331] mb-4 tracking-tighter">Atendimento Empresarial</h3>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed">Atendemos empresas, galpões, condomínios e construtoras com programação alinhada aos horários, acessos e etapas de cada serviço.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- 3. Modelos de caçamba -->
	<section aria-labelledby="modelos-cacamba">
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12">
			<span class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-green-700 mb-3">Escolha conforme a sua obra</span>
			<h2 id="modelos-cacamba" class="text-3xl md:text-[47px] font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tighter">
				Modelos de <span class="text-green-700">caçamba de entulho</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				Compare os tamanhos disponíveis e consulte a página de cada modelo. A indicação final considera o material, o volume estimado e o acesso ao endereço em Guarulhos.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-5 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
			{modelosDestaque.map((servico) => (
				<article class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden hover:border-green-600 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
					<a href={`/servicos/${servico.id}`} class="block bg-green-50 p-5" aria-label={`Conhecer ${servico.data.title}`}>
						<img src={servico.data.image} alt={servico.data.title} width="480" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-contain" />
					</a>
					<div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3">{servico.data.title}</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-5 line-clamp-4">{servico.data.description}</p>
						<a href={`/servicos/${servico.id}`} class="mt-auto text-green-700 font-black hover:underline">Ver detalhes →</a>
					</div>
				</article>
			))}
		</div>

		<div class="text-center mt-10">
			<a href="/servicos" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 font-black rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-200 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all">
				Comparar todos os serviços
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- 4. Soluções em Caçambas para Obras e Empresas -->
	<section id="solucoes" class="scroll-mt-20">
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-[47px] font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tighter">
				Soluções em Caçambas para <span class="text-green-700">Obras e Empresas</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				Atendimento para reformas, condomínios, construtoras e empresas em Guarulhos, com orientação para escolher a capacidade adequada e planejar cada retirada.
			</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
			{solucoesObras.map((item) => (
				<div class="bg-white p-7 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-100 hover:border-green-600 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-green-900/10 flex flex-col justify-between group">
					<div>
						<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-green-50 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-green-700 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm">
							{item.icone === "residencial" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"/>
								</svg>
							)}
							{item.icone === "condominio" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/>
								</svg>
							)}
							{item.icone === "construtora" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/>
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 9h4m0 4h4m6-4h4"/>
								</svg>
							)}
							{item.icone === "empresa" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 14v3m4-3v3m4-3v3M3 21h18M3 10h18M3 7l9-4 9 4M4 10h16v11H4V10z"/>
								</svg>
							)}
							{item.icone === "demolicao" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/>
								</svg>
							)}
							{item.icone === "troca" && (
								<svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
								</svg>
							)}
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-green-700 transition-colors tracking-tight leading-snug">
							{item.titulo}
						</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
							{item.descricao}
						</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100 mb-6">
							<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 block mb-2.5">
								Capacidades relacionadas:
							</span>
							<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
								{item.capacidades.map(cap => (
									<span class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm md:text-base font-black bg-green-50/70 text-green-800 border border-green-200/60 group-hover:bg-green-100 group-hover:border-green-300 transition-colors">
										{cap}
									</span>
								))}
							</div>
						</div>

						<a 
							href={item.link} 
							class="inline-flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3.5 bg-gray-50 group-hover:bg-green-700 text-gray-900 group-hover:text-white font-black rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-sm shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:shadow-green-700/30"
						>
							<span>{item.botao}</span>
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform duration-300">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>

		<div class="mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
			<a href="/servicos" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 bg-green-700 text-white font-black rounded-xl hover:bg-green-800 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-lg text-center">
				Ver Todos os Serviços
			</a>
